-- Full re-import of the OurAirports dataset (user-provided CSV) — replaces the
-- prior import, which was missing a non-trivial number of legitimate,
-- ICAO-coded airports (e.g. KUAO, KOEB) despite them being present in the
-- source file. Root cause of the gap was never fully identified, so this
-- rebuilds the table cleanly from the source instead of patching individual
-- rows. Filter: type in (large_airport, medium_airport, small_airport);
-- prefers the "ident" column as the ICAO code, falling back to "gps_code"
-- when "ident" isn't 4-letter ICAO-shaped (covers airports where
-- OurAirports lists the FAA local code as ident and the real ICAO/GPS code
-- separately, e.g. Nunapitchuk: ident "16A", gps_code "PPIT"); excludes
-- closed/heliport/seaplane_base/balloonport (not relevant to fixed-wing
-- charter) and OurAirports' own "ZZ" placeholder entries.

DELETE FROM "Airport";





